:["Dupliceren"],"Feed Duplicated":["Feed gedupliceerd"],"Create your feed":["Maak je feed"],"Connect your Google, Facebook, Yelp or Tripadvisor account and choose a feed type":["Verbind je Google, Facebook, Yelp of Tripadvisor account en kies een feed type"],"Customize your feed type":["Je feed type personaliseren"],"Choose layouts, color schemes, filters and more":["Kies lay-outs, kleurenschema's, filters en meer"],"Embed your feed":["Je feed insluiten"],"Easily add the feed anywhere on your website":["Voeg de feed eenvoudig overal op je site toe"],"Edit Products":[""],"Enter a name for this source":[""],"Saving...":[""],"Network error. Please check your connection and try again.":[""],"Add Source":["Bron toevoegen"],"Loading, please wait":[""],"Review Feed Pro by Smash Balloon":["Review Feed Pro door Smash Balloon"],"Activate your plugin to get started":["Activeer je plugin om aan de slag te gaan"],"Paste license key here":["Plak licentiesleutel hier"],"License Activated!":["Licentie geactiveerd!"],"Invalid License!":["Ongeldige licentie!"],"Don\u2019t have a license key?":["Heb je geen licentiesleutel?"],"Buy a License":["Koop een licentie"],"After activating your plugin, you can...":["Na het activeren van je plugin, kun je..."],"Collect New Reviews":["Verzamel nieuwe beoordelingen"],"New reviews and data related to the reviews for your business are collected from external sites. Your license key can be used to access this data using Smash Balloon's API site.":["Nieuwe beoordelingen en gegevens met betrekking tot de beoordelingen voor je bedrijf worden verzameld van externe sites. Je licentiesleutel kan worden gebruikt om toegang te krijgen tot deze gegevens via de API-site van Smash Balloon."],"With constant changes to WordPress and the APIs that your reviews are retrieved from, your plugin needs to stay up to date. Activating your license allows automatic updates from the Plugins page.":["Met constante wijzigingen aan WordPress en de API's waarvandaan je beoordelingen worden opgehaald, moet je plugin up-to-date blijven. Het activeren van je licentiesleutel maakt automatische updates vanaf de pagina Plugins mogelijk."],"Receive Technical Support":["Ontvang technische ondersteuning"],"Although we pride ourselves on creating reliable, easy-to-use products our expert support team is here to help with any questions. Activating your license key is recommended to receive efficient support.":["Hoewel we trots zijn op het cre\u00ebren van betrouwbare, gebruiksvriendelijke producten, staat ons deskundige ondersteuningsteam klaar om te helpen bij eventuele vragen. Het activeren van je licentiesleutel wordt aanbevolen om effici\u00ebnte ondersteuning te ontvangen."],"Amazing Support Team.":["Geweldig ondersteuningsteam."],"Having trouble using the plugin?":["Problemen met het gebruik van de plugin?"],"Contact our friendly support team.":["Neem contact op met ons vriendelijke ondersteuningsteam."],"Go to Support Form":["Ga naar het ondersteuningsformulier"],"Create a feed":["Maak een feed"],"Dashboard":["Dashboard"],"Create a Review feed":["Maak een beoordelingen feed"],"more":[""],"Confirm":["Bevestigen"],"You are using the new Google Places API":[""],"New API":[""],"License Key ":["Licentiesleutel "],"Your ":["Je "]," License is ":[" Licentie is "],"Active":["Actief"],"Inactive":["Inactief"],"Expired":["Verlopen"],"Manage License":["Beheer licentie"],"Test Connection":["Test verbinding"],"Connection Error":["Verbindingsfout"],"Upgrade":["Upgrade"],"Deactivate":["Deactiveren"],"This source is not used by any feeds.":[""],"Are you sure you want to delete it?":[""],"feed":[""],"This source is used by":[""],"Delete ":["Verwijder "],"Source Deleted!":["Bron verwijderd!"],"Select feed to export":[""],"Export":["Export"],"Original Text":["Originele tekst"],"Custom text\/translation":["Aangepaste tekst\/vertaling"],"Context":["Context"],"New Reviews collected daily.":["Nieuwe beoordelingen worden dagelijks verzameld."],"Clearing caches will trigger a full resync of all reviews. This may take a few minutes and could temporarily slow down your site.":[""],"Clear All Caches":["Alle caches legen"],"You are using the Lite version of the plugin\u2013no license needed. Enjoy! \ud83d\ude42 To unlock more features, consider ":["Je gebruikt de Lite versie van de plugin - geen licentie nodig. Geniet ervan! \ud83d\ude42 Om meer functies te ontgrendelen, overweeg "],"Upgrading to Pro":["Upgraden naar Pro"],"As a valued user of our Lite plugin, you receive 50% OFF - automatically applied at checkout!":["Als een gewaardeerde gebruiker van onze Lite plugin, ontvang je 50% KORTING - automatisch toegepast bij het afrekenen!"],"Install Pro":["Installeer Pro"],"Select collection to export":[""],"Collection JSON exported!":[""],"Save Changes":["Wijzigingen opslaan"],"Plugin Installed":["Plugin ge\u00efnstalleerd"],"Unknown Error":["Onbekende fout"],"Plugin Activated":["Plugin geactiveerd"],"Plugin Deactivated":["Plugin gedeactiveerd"],"About Us":["Over ons"],"SmashBalloon Team":["SmashBalloon team"],"At Smash Balloon, we build software that helps you create beautiful responsive social media feeds for your website in minutes.":["Bij Smash Balloon bouwen we software waarmee je in enkele minuten prachtige responsive sociale media feeds voor je site kan maken."],"We're on a mission to make it super simple to add social media feeds in WordPress. No more complicated setup steps, ugly iframe widgets, or negative page speed scores.":["We zijn op een missie om het supereenvoudig te maken om sociale media feeds toe te voegen in WordPress. Geen ingewikkelde installatiestappen meer, lelijke iFrame widgets, of negatieve pagina snelheid scores."],"Our plugins aren't just easy to use, but completely customizable, reliable, and fast! Which is why over 1.6 million awesome users, just like you, choose to use them on their site.":["Onze plugins zijn niet alleen gemakkelijk te gebruiken, maar ook volledig aanpasbaar, betrouwbaar en snel! Daarom kiezen meer dan 1,6 miljoen geweldige gebruikers, net als je, ervoor om ze op hun site te gebruiken."],"Our Other Social Media Feed Plugins":["Onze andere plugins voor sociale media feeds"],"We're more than just a Reviews plugin! Check out our other plugins and add more content to your site.":["We zijn meer dan alleen een beoordelingen plugin! Bekijk onze andere plugins en voeg meer inhoud toe aan je site."],"Install":["Installeer"],"Installed":["Ge\u00efnstalleerd"],"Social Wall":["Social Wall"],"Combine feeds from all of our plugins into a single wall":["Combineer feeds van al onze plugins in een enkele wall"],"Plugins we recommend":["Plugins die we aanbevelen"],"What are they used for?":[""],"Solving an issue in your plugin might sometime require testing API access but with your setup. We do not want to expose your API keys over support messages and hence we use a temporary login link system to securely access it.":[""],"What can a support executive access?":[""],"A support team member can only access Smash Balloon plugin to make API requests. They can NOT access any other plugins, create posts or in any way modify your WordPress website.":[""],"Can I disable or delete the temporary login link?":[""],"The login link is auto-destroyed in 14 days. You can also manually delete it any time you want.":[""],"Temporary Login Links":[""],"Dismiss":["Negeren"],"Search Documentation":["Documentatie zoeken"],"Need more support? We're here to help.":["Meer ondersteuning nodig? Wij zijn er om je te helpen."],"Submit a Support Ticket":["Dien een ondersteuning ticket in"],"Get Help in the WordPress.org Forum":["Krijg hulp in het WordPress.org forum"],"Our fast and friendly support team is always happy to help!":["Ons snelle en vriendelijke ondersteuningsteam staat altijd klaar om te helpen!"],"System Info":["Systeem info"],"Collapse":["Samenvouwen"],"Expand":["Uitvouwen"],"Export Settings":["Export instellingen"],"Share your plugin settings easily with Support":["Deel je plugin instellingen eenvoudig met de ondersteuning"],"Temporary Login":[""],"Our team might require temporary login access with limited access to only our plugin to help you test your issues":[""],"Create Temporary Login Link":[""],"Temporary User Created":[""],"Temporary Login link for support access created by you. This is auto-destructed 14 days after creation. To create a new link, please delete the old one.":[""],"Link":["Link"],"Temporary User Deleted":[""],"Please enter you business name as it is in Google":[""],"Business name to search for Place ID":[""],"Business ID found":[""],"Clear Log":[""],"Code":[""],"Details":[""],"Moderate review feeds":["Beoordeling feeds modereren"],"Display images and videos":["Toon afbeeldingen en video's"],"Upsell Modal Icon":["Upsell modal pictogram"],"And get much more!":["En krijg zoveel meer!"],"Add reviews to your collection":[""],"Organize reviews into collections, embed collections on any page":[""],"Collections help you organize your reviews in collections such as \u201cHomepage reviews\u201d or \u201cProduct reviews\u201d. You can then use them as a reviews source in any feed.":[""],"Add your first review to this collection":[""],"Add reviews from Google, Facebook, TrustPilot or Yelp. Collections help you hand-pick reviews and embed them on pages.":[""],"Create handpicked reviews collections to make the best first impression.":[""],"Or get them from your audience":[""],"You can also connect a form from WPForms or Formidable forms.":[""],"Add these collections as source on any feed. These work just like any other sources.":[""],"Name your Collection":[""],"Eg. Homepage Reviews":[""],"What are collections?":[""],"By duplicating this collection, all the reviews created and added to this collection will be duplicated too!":[""],"By deleting this collection, all the reviews created and added for it will be deleted too":[""],"Empty Collections Icon":[""],"Create collections of handpicked reviews to showcase them on your websit